{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow and Crossbreed Your Own Vegetables.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise crops while experimenting with soil and compost,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and create brand-new varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of vegetables will you grow? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/e1536d1a61a887f6e9cbcf051e3b1df6.avif?t=1773899458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras_big/e1536d1a61a887f6e9cbcf051e3b1df6.avif?t=1773899458 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Skills in the Vegetable Contest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with rivals and aim for victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with vegetables that match the theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/4039a9cadd3e9bc595e109354975e87d.avif?t=1773899458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras_big/4039a9cadd3e9bc595e109354975e87d.avif?t=1773899458 width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Sales or Wholesale\u2014How Will You Sell?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put in the effort to earn higher prices,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or ship in bulk for efficiency?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all about your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/66b0c42b00ca0812e74c5805f1c82af8.avif?t=1773899458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras_big/66b0c42b00ca0812e74c5805f1c82af8.avif?t=1773899458 width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own carefully cultivated vegetables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and create special varieties that are uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/ce5a152586872f069fd0a5ac10911e24.avif?t=1773899458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras_big/ce5a152586872f069fd0a5ac10911e24.avif?t=1773899458 width=800 height=627 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609130?t=1773899458","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/998c2d5554ca0f23253edd263a976bed1a79d086/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773899458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/5b75314207151a44824728b6ade58c3e69da8874/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773899458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/5b75314207151a44824728b6ade58c3e69da8874/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773899458","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow and Crossbreed Your Own Vegetables.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise crops while experimenting with soil and compost,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and create brand-new varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of vegetables will you grow? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/e1536d1a61a887f6e9cbcf051e3b1df6.avif?t=1773899458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i